    {
      "name": "tidely_list_invoices",
      "description": "List sales or purchase invoices (paged): id, number, contact, dates, gross and open amount, status, category, type, source (ERP sync, manual, API, upload) and external id. Filter by status, number, external id, category, source or exact contact name; array filters take up to 100 values.",
